**WEB**
How to run
Locally without Docker (3 terminals):


.\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn main:app --app-dir web/nomad --port 8001
.\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn main:app --app-dir web/echo --port 8002
.\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn main:app --app-dir web/gateway --port 8000

and frontend
cd web/frontend
bun dev


